A||||2||deceler8||Fatal accident involving a Fiero...||||1||
Z||000000||deceler8||11-23-2000||06:36 PM||||Apparently on Tuesday night a head-on collision occurred north of LeMars, Iowa on Highway 75 involving a semi and a Fiero...the driver of the Fiero was killed.<P>The story was in the Sioux City, Iowa Journal and I am unable to locate a link. The local news station covered the accident and the remains of the car was unrecognizable.<P>My sincere condolences go out to the individual killed in the accident, and I hope it did not involve a Forum member.||||reg||1
Z||000001||wahoo4u||11-23-2000||11:39 PM||||so it was a fiero.  I had heard about the accident and heard that it was a fiero.  I was told all that was left was a rim.  My since condolences to the family.||||reg||11
Z||000002||Cheever2||11-24-2000||01:38 AM||||Well, there's this online, but my quick search found nothing about it... <A HREF="http://www.siouxcityjournal.com/" TARGET=_blank>http://www.siouxcityjournal.com/</A> <P>You can also try <A HREF="http://www.siouxlan.com" TARGET=_blank>www.siouxlan.com</A> <P>My sympathy to the family for their loss.<P><BR><p>[This message has been edited by Cheever2 (edited 11-24-2000).]||||reg||1
